        "id": 550,
        "slug": "secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln",
        "status": "publish",
        "title": "Secrets Of The Silent Witch (WN)",
        "link": "https://yumenovel.fr/secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln/",
        "date": "2024-12-31T14:18:56",
        "modified": "2026-08-22T13:06:15",
        "author": 181654947,
        "parent": 0,
        "menu_order": 0,
        "template": "",
        "featured_media": 564,
        "excerpt": "",
        "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Noms :</strong> Secrets Of The Silent Witch / サイレント・ウィッチ　沈黙の魔女の隠しごと<br><strong>Scénario :</strong> Isora Matsuri<br><strong>Illustrations :</strong> Fujimi Nanna<br><strong>Nombre de volumes VO :</strong> 16 Tomes (Terminé)<br><strong>Editeur VO :</strong> Kadokawa Books<br><strong>Traduction/Relecture :</strong> En cours (TR : T.11 / REC : T.8)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Résumé</strong> : <em><strong>Monica Everett</strong> est une frêle jeune fille, elle vit dans une cabane en forêt avec son familier <strong>Nero</strong> et s'éloigne au maximum des autres. Mais <strong>Monica</strong> a des secrets. C'est par exemple l'une des <em>7 sages</em>, un groupe de personne ayant reçu ce titre grâce à leur talent en magie, mais surtout elle est la seule personne capable d'effectuer de la magie sans incantation, lui conférant ainsi le titre de <em>Sorcière du Silence</em>. </em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cliquez sur le nom des arcs pour commencer la lecture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size has-small-font-size\"><strong>Bonne lecture</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":553,\"mediaLink\":\"https://yumenovel.wordpress.com/secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln/attachment/61774221/\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://yumenovel.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/61774221.jpg?w=682\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-553 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Contenu…\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><a href=\"https://yumenovel.fr/arc-1-rentree-academique-silent-witch/\"><strong>ARC 1</strong> <strong>| RENTRÉE ACADÉMIQUE</strong></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":2047,\"mediaLink\":\"https://yumenovel.fr/secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln/design-sans-titre-3/\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://yumenovel.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/design-sans-titre-3.jpg?w=683\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2047 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Contenu…\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"https://yumenovel.fr/arc-2-la-vie-academique-silent-witch/\">ARC 2 | LA VIE ACADÉMIQUE</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":2049,\"mediaLink\":\"https://yumenovel.fr/secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln/gemini_generated_image_sm4bfssm4bfssm4b/\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://yumenovel.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gemini_generated_image_sm4bfssm4bfssm4b.png?w=680\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2049 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Contenu…\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"https://yumenovel.fr/arc-3-conseil-des-eleves-silent-witch/\">ARC 3 | CONSEIL DES ÉLÈVES</a> </strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":650,\"mediaLink\":\"https://yumenovel.fr/secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln/sw2/\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://yumenovel.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/sw2.jpg?w=683\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-650 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Contenu…\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"https://yumenovel.fr/arc-4-bal-de-lacademie-silent-witch/\">ARC 4 | BAL DE L'ACADÉMIE</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":2051,\"mediaLink\":\"https://yumenovel.fr/secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln/design-sans-titre-4/\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://yumenovel.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/design-sans-titre-4.jpg?w=683\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2051 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Contenu…\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"https://yumenovel.fr/arc-5-la-tea-party-silent-witch/\">ARC 5 | LA TEA PARTY</a></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":2053,\"mediaLink\":\"https://yumenovel.fr/secrets-of-the-silent-witch-ln/design-sans-titre-5/\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://yumenovel.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/design-sans-titre-5.jpg?w=683\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2053 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Contenu…\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"